@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle uml2
title Logical components | child-only app and separate content administration
package "Expo React Native child app" {
 [Child navigation / profile] as Shell
 [Content renderers] as Renderer
 [Local progress + outbox] as Outbox
 Shell --> Renderer
 Renderer --> Outbox
}
[Admin web client\n(proposed)] as Admin
package "One backend application (proposed)" {
 [Authenticated / scoped API] as API
 [Child identity / sessions / recovery] as Identity
 [Admin authentication] as AdminAuth
 [Catalog / publication / locale editions] as Content
 [Learning progress] as Progress
 [Character / practice / rewards] as Practice
 [Media authorization / processing] as Media
 [Editorial audit / operations] as Audit
 API --> Identity
 API --> AdminAuth
 API --> Content
 API --> Progress
 API --> Practice
 API --> Media
 Content --> Media : readiness
 Content --> Audit
}
database "Transactional persistence\n(engine TBD)" as DB
cloud "Media storage / delivery\n(provider TBD)" as Storage
Shell --> API : learner-scoped HTTPS
Outbox --> API : idempotent progress
Admin --> API : admin-authorized operations
Identity --> DB
AdminAuth --> DB
Content --> DB
Progress --> DB
Practice --> DB
Audit --> DB
Media --> Storage
Renderer --> Storage : authorized reference
note bottom of DB
Logical modules can share one database.
Child access/recovery and providers remain open.
No companion-account or monitoring module.
end note
@enduml
